        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/EG26_GtaWeek_HeaderImage_Dev2b.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Hello! This idea started as a single theme week, which we thought we might run in the lead up to <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-everything-we-know-so-far-9357\">Grand Theft Auto 6</a>'s launch. Then it turned into a pair of theme weeks. Then we realised we had so much stuff - and that, frankly, GTA 6 would be so dominating it'll be around for far more than a week itself - that we couldn't really fit it into two weeks either.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/introducing-gta-and-not-gta-theme-weeks\">Read more</a></p>",
