        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-6-Jason-Duval.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>With less than a week to go before <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-most-preordered-game-playstation-store-history\">GTA 6's hugely anticipated release</a>, the game's final map - or at least a stylised poster version of it, depicting the state of Leonida's key landmarks - has surfaced online. It was reportedly snapped during Selfridge's sizable <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-everything-we-know-so-far-9357\">GTA 6</a>'s takeover, and is seemingly the physical map included in Rockstar's &pound;350 collector's edition.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-map-leak-online-collectors-edition\">Read more</a></p>",
